{"650750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HYPERNOVA: Escape from Hadea", "steam_appid": 650750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERNOVA: Escape from Hadea</strong> is a vibrant real‑time strategy and tower‑defense hybrid where you lead the Scynthian civilization in a desperate mission to survive. Your star is collapsing and your only hope is to land on the toxic moon Haya, gather rare resources, and build the Stellar Bridge before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, expand, defend, and outsmart the strange creatures that inhabit this hostile world. Every decision matters: where you land, what you research, how you build your defenses, and how you grow your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>classic RTS</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, or <strong>base‑building with real strategic depth</strong>, this is your next obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/extras/9c02d95c138317840d76a40e3a1ab211.avif?t=1768385974\" width=616 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes HYPERNOVA Unique</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTS + Tower Defense = RTDS</strong><br>A seamless hybrid where base‑building, resource management, and tactical tower placement all matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Charming World With Real Challenge</strong><br>Cute creatures, colorful biomes, but don’t be fooled. Haya is dangerous, and your colony will be tested.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Build Your Strategy</strong><br>Choose your landing zone, expand in any direction, and unlock tech in a non‑linear tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Race Against Extinction</strong> <br>Your star is dying. Your mission is urgent. Every resource and every tower counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/extras/c91007626341dc8e06d86bf42db581fa.webp?t=1768385974\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast open world</strong> filled with unique landscapes and hidden relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather and refine resources</strong> to power your growing colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build settlements</strong> to keep your Scynthians alive in a toxic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research dozens of technologies</strong> to unlock new buildings, defenses, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct a powerful tower‑defense network</strong> to repel waves of hostile creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the Stellar Bridge</strong>, your civilization’s last hope for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay with different strategies</strong> thanks to open‑ended progression and landing choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERNOVA: Escape from Hadea</strong> is a vibrant real‑time strategy and tower‑defense hybrid where you lead the Scynthian civilization in a desperate mission to survive. Your star is collapsing and your only hope is to land on the toxic moon Haya, gather rare resources, and build the Stellar Bridge before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, expand, defend, and outsmart the strange creatures that inhabit this hostile world. Every decision matters: where you land, what you research, how you build your defenses, and how you grow your population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love <strong>classic RTS</strong>, <strong>tower defense</strong>, or <strong>base‑building with real strategic depth</strong>, this is your next obsession.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/extras/9c02d95c138317840d76a40e3a1ab211.avif?t=1768385974\" width=616 height=213 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Makes HYPERNOVA Unique</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RTS + Tower Defense = RTDS</strong><br>A seamless hybrid where base‑building, resource management, and tactical tower placement all matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Charming World With Real Challenge</strong><br>Cute creatures, colorful biomes, but don’t be fooled. Haya is dangerous, and your colony will be tested.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Build Your Strategy</strong><br>Choose your landing zone, expand in any direction, and unlock tech in a non‑linear tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Race Against Extinction</strong> <br>Your star is dying. Your mission is urgent. Every resource and every tower counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/extras/c91007626341dc8e06d86bf42db581fa.webp?t=1768385974\" width=616 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a vast open world</strong> filled with unique landscapes and hidden relics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather and refine resources</strong> to power your growing colony.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build settlements</strong> to keep your Scynthians alive in a toxic atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research dozens of technologies</strong> to unlock new buildings, defenses, and upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct a powerful tower‑defense network</strong> to repel waves of hostile creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the Stellar Bridge</strong>, your civilization’s last hope for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay with different strategies</strong> thanks to open‑ended progression and landing choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A colorful but challenging blend of classic RTS and tower defense. Build, expand, research, and defend your alien colony as you race to construct a teleportation device and escape a dying star.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“An entertaining combination of tower defense, environmental planning, and zany game design, Hypernova quickly draws you in and holds your interest.”<br>8/10 – GamingCypher<br><br>“The game is quite fun and if you’re in the market for something unique to play, then Hypernova is definitely worth checking out.”<br>8.7/10 – End World Gaming<br><br>“Ce jeu n’a certainement pas de quoi rougir et pour cause : c’est un agréable retour aux sources pour les fans du genre.”<br>8/10 – GamersFlag<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/header.jpg?t=1768385974", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/6bbe59a35f354912e2347573cc3c066288252d0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768385974", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/650750/6bbe59a35f354912e2347573cc3c066288252d0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768385974", "website": "https://www.actalogi